{"id":"river-somme","name":"River Somme","qid":"Q37646","country":"France","locality":"Hauts-de-France","lat":"50.2197","lon":"1.4976","built":"","year":null,"year_text":"","century":"","era":"Natural formations","period":"","date_basis":"","style":"","heritage":"","type":"main stem; coastal river","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Somme_(river)","text":"The Somme (UK:  SOM, US:  SUM; French: [sɔm] ; Picard: Sonme) is a river in Picardy, northern France. The river is 245 km (152 mi) in length, from its source in the high ground of the former Arrouaise Forest at Fonsomme near Saint-Quentin, to the Bay of the Somme, in the English Channel. It lies in the geological syncline which also forms the Solent.","text_source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Somme_(river)","text_license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","real":[],"depictions":[{"id":"battlefield-1--battlefield-1-river-somme","game":"battlefield-1","name":"Battlefield 1 River Somme","verified":false,"text":"","text_source":"","text_license":"","images":[{"id":"gh-pdbde5f90d81","w":1280,"h":720,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Battlefield 1, © Electronic Arts.","source":"https://battlefield.fandom.com/wiki/File:Battlefield_1_River_Somme_2.jpg","via":"Fandom (battlefield)","note":"Fandom upload by Lamicrosz on 2018-02-28"}}]},{"id":"battlefield-1--river-somme","game":"battlefield-1","name":"River Somme","verified":false,"text":"River Somme River Somme is a map featured in the Battlefield 1: Apocalypse expansion. This map is set during the infamous \"First day on the Somme\". British casualties on this day were the worst in the history of the British army, with 57,470 British casualties, 19,240 of whom were killed, the most out of any single day of the Battle of the Somme.","text_source":"https://battlefield.fandom.com/wiki/River_Somme","text_license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","images":[{"id":"gh-5b7784478460","w":1400,"h":788,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Battlefield 1, © Electronic Arts.","source":"https://battlefield.fandom.com